Dear <%= @customer.display_name %>,

<% if @days_remaining.zero? -%>
Your policy <%= @policy.policy_number %> (<%= @policy.plan_name %>) expired today, <%= @policy.policy_end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") %>.

Please get in touch with your agent to renew it and stay covered.
<% else -%>
Your policy <%= @policy.policy_number %> (<%= @policy.plan_name %>) is expiring in <%= @days_remaining %> <%= @days_remaining == 1 ? "day" : "days" %>, on <%= @policy.policy_end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") %>.

Please renew it before it expires to stay covered without interruption.
<% end -%>

Thank you,
InsureBook
